,"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentAdded"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentRemoved"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/FamilyMemberAdded"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/FamilyMemberRemoved"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Value change events are opt-in:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentReplaced"},{"type":"text","text":": a component was set on an entity that already had one of that type."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentModified"},{"type":"text","text":": a component of one entity was changed in place."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified"},{"type":"text","text":": a bulk write pass changed the components of a type. One event per pass, not one per entity; "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified\/count"},{"type":"text","text":" is the number of components the pass could write."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every event names its entity with the generational "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityIdentifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", so a stale identifier never matches a later entity in the same slot."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Subscribing","level":3,"anchor":"Subscribing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate\/subscribedEvents"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/structural"},{"type":"text","text":" by default. Return "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/valueChanges"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/all"},{"type":"text","text":" to receive value changes:"}]},{"code":["final class Observer: NexusEventDelegate {","    var subscribedEvents: NexusEventMask { .all }","","    func nexusEvent(_ event: NexusEvent) {","        switch event {","        case let added as ComponentAdded:","            print(\"added\", added.component, \"to\", added.toEntity)","        case let modified as ComponentModified:","            print(\"modified\", modified.component, \"of\", modified.entityId)","        default:","            break","        }","    }","","    func nexusNonFatalError(_ message: String) {}","}","","nexus.delegate = observer"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","isActive":true},{"text":" is an open protocol and later releases add events. Always switch with a ","type":"text"},{"code":"default:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" case.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The nexus reads ","type":"text"},{"code":"subscribedEvents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" once, when the delegate is assigned. After changing the subscription, assign the delegate again: ","type":"text"},{"code":"nexus.delegate = observer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/structural","type":"reference"},{"text":" is informational. Structural events are always delivered, as in FirebladeECS 1, also to a delegate whose mask does not contain it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Cost","level":3,"anchor":"Cost"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With the default mask a write to a component costs one branch on a flag the nexus caches, and nothing else: the delegate is not called and no event is created."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Ordering","text":"Ordering"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Modifying a component that is missing, with a default value, delivers "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentAdded","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and then "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentModified","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Setting a component the entity does not have yet delivers "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentAdded","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" only, never "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentReplaced","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Setting a component the entity already has replaces it and delivers "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentReplaced","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to delegates that subscribed to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/valueChanges","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Comparison-with-flecs","text":"Comparison with flecs"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"flecs observers (OnAdd, OnRemove, OnSet) fire on an actual add or remove, and OnSet fires on every "},{"code":"set","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and on an explicit "},{"code":"modified()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" call, but not on direct writes through a pointer. Setting a missing component fires OnAdd and then OnSet. Observers cost nothing while none exist."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"FirebladeECS differs on purpose: in-place writes through the nexus emit "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentModified","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" automatically, so there is no "},{"code":"modified()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" call to forget, and setting a missing component emits "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentAdded","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" only."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/reactingtonexusevents"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Reacting to Nexus events","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"Observe structural changes and, on request, changes of component values.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/FamilyMemberRemoved":{"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/familymemberremoved","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":